  "readmeFile": "readme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.1-preview.24\n- Adds the Uno Platform integration for Firebase Messaging. UseUno() delegates to the platform package that matches the Uno head the application is running on: Messaging.Browser on WebAssembly, Messaging.Android on Android, and Messaging.Apple on iOS and Mac Catalyst.\n- The package references no Uno package and stays framework-independent, exactly as the .Maui packages reference no MAUI package. The head is detected at runtime, so the browser and Skia-desktop heads share the plain net10.0 asset.\n- Fails fast with UnoFirebaseMessagingException on the Windows head, because FireForNet ships no Windows Messaging implementation, and on the Skia desktop head, including Linux.",
